O<touchoff> sub

G21                    ; Metric mode
G90                    ; Absolute positioning
F100                   ; Set probe feedrate (mm/min)

G38.2 Z-50             ; Probe down max 50mm until switch triggers
G92 Z0                 ; Set current position as Z0
G0 Z5                  ; Rapid up to 5mm clearance

O<touchoff> endsub
